# Embedded key baked into the distributed build so end users get AI Chat
# working out of the box, with no setup of their own. Leave unset for local
# dev — the app falls back to requiring a user-supplied key in Settings,
# exactly like it does today.
#
# NEVER commit the real value. Put it in a local .env (already gitignored).
# Traffic against this key is soft-rate-limited locally per install — see
# src/main/constants/ai-limits.ts.
BUILTIN_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
